WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.294 --> 00:00:04.922
Okay, Snoopy, we'll start
with a simple command.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.548
Ready? Sit.

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:10.594
(squeals)

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:12.846
- Shake.
- (blender whirring)

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.974
That's delicious.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.394
(timer dings)

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.737
(shouts happily)

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:32.324
Why can't I just have a normal dog?

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.494
- Way to go, Snoopy!
- Bravo!

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.291
(screams)

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:44.169
- Hey, Chuck, can you tell
the funny-looking kid to keep it down?

00:00:47.256 --> 00:00:48.757
(howls)

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.053
(yells)

